# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DeployGuard NLP Service — Environment Variables
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Groq API — used for:
#   1. AI regression explanations on failed PR checks (/explain)
#   2. AI project health reviews on the dashboard (/review)
#   3. LLM fallback when local ML confidence < 0.55 (/classify)
#
# Get your free API key at: https://console.groq.com
# Rate limits: 30 req/min on the free tier (generous for CI workloads)
GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_your_groq_key_here

# Override the default Groq model (optional)
# Default: llama-3.3-70b-versatile  (best quality for complex analysis)
# Alternative: llama-3.1-8b-instant  (faster, still capable)
# GROQ_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile
